ch called \"the Omnitrix,\" with the help of Ben can turn into ten different aliens, which come up with different supernatural powers. He fights enemy aliens and experiences with his grandfather and cousin the most exciting vacation imaginable.","poster_path":"/a4H0UR7aUkGZlT6Q9r9grBrjJWR.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[10762,16,35,10759,10765],"popularity":41.2635,"first_air_date":"2016-10-01","softcore":false,"vote_average":5.884,"vote_count":224,"origin_country":["GB","US"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/qxZpjuNTECc8nTibvujSFSidU2l.jpg","id":23022,"name":"Astro Boy","original_name":"鉄腕アトム","overview":"In 2030 AD, after being abandoned by his creator, a young boy robot is rescued by an Android Advocate, Dr Elefun, who adopts him as his own and guides him in the use of his special powers to aid and protect mankind and robot-kind.","poster_path":"/u3LVqlU9OLVN18uwIazxwgDVgdZ.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"ja","genre_ids":[16,10759,10765,35,10751,10762],"popularity":11.8418,"first_air_date":"1980-10-01","softcore":false,"vote_average":7.823,"vote_count":96,"origin_country":["JP"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/hp8sSFPnh8n0BPkGRlRUzlsEUcb.jpg","id":75911,"name":"Transformers: Energon","original_name":"トランスフォーマー スーパーリンク","overview":"The show takes place ten years after the finale of Armada, opening in an age of peace on Cybertron and Earth which is destined not to last long. Energon pits the Autobots against an array of villains: the reborn Megatron , the barely functional Unicron, and the mysterious Alpha Q and his Terrorcon minions.","poster_path":"/bNoznz2CDSWbarJ1NuT0m6zU2SP.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"ja","genre_ids":[10759,16,10762],"popularity":14.0482,"first_air_date":"2004-01-09","softcore":false,"vote_average":6.8,"vote_count":21,"origin_country":["JP"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/A7zBjRDFh1TXG3Buhi55mmS1qSr.jpg","id":66558,"name":"Voltron: Legendary Defender","original_name":"Voltron: Lege